   "source": [
    "# Evident — pipeline demo\n",
    "\n",
    "**Explainable KYC document intelligence.** This notebook runs the real\n",
    "`evident` pipeline (the same code in `src/evident/`, not a re-implementation) on\n",
    "documents that already live in this repo's `data/` folder, and shows every stage:\n",
    "\n",
    "image → **OCR** → **field extraction** → **deterministic rules** →\n",
    "**cross-document consistency** → **decomposed confidence** → **routing** →\n",
    "**evidence-linked report**.\n",
    "\n",
    "It covers Phases 0–2. Phase 3 (RAG) will add grounded, cited answers to\n",
    "*\"why was this flagged?\"*; Phase 4 adds the risk agent + human review.\n",
    "\n",
    "> Requires an OCR engine (Tesseract by default — see the README's Phase 1 section).\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "aeef4dad",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Setup"
