    "## 7 · RAG — grounding *\"why was this flagged?\"*\n",
    "\n",
    "The headline feature. Each anomaly is grounded in a **retrieved, cited compliance\n",
    "rule** from the knowledge base — so the report doesn't just say *expired*, it points\n",
    "to the rule that says expired documents aren't acceptable. No LLM is required for\n",
    "this (retrieval + citation); an Ollama-written answer is an optional add-on that is\n",
    "checked against its citations before it's trusted."
   ]
  },
