    "## 8 · The risk agent\n",
    "\n",
    "The one true agent (blueprint §8): a **reason → act → observe** loop that chooses\n",
    "which tool to call next from what it has seen, and stops when it can recommend or\n",
    "escalate. Its decision is **advisory only** — a human decides. Here it runs on the\n",
    "expired case: watch the trajectory (which tools it called, in order) and the\n",
    "rationale it produced."
   ]
  },
